This is exciting.

13
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:30.660
We're in a new year.

14
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.380
Man, oh man, New Year.

15
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.960
I'm in a new size pants.

16
