20
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.780
I'm going to keep it really simple.

21
00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.200
I'm just going to move more.

22
00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:55.840
You know, I did that, Ange, because I felt really creaky when I would wake up in the morning.

23
00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.000
