It's a good thing.

28
00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.020
Yeah.

29
00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:07.160
I'm just going to go on more walks.

30
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.780
This is my big New Year's resolution.

31
00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:10.840
More walking.

32
00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.840
I think that's good.

33
