It's good for your health in so many ways.

35
00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:17.640
Yeah.

36
00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:18.500
I'm for this.

37
00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.400
I can't make my resolutions too complicated or it won't happen.

38
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.680
So I'm keeping it real simple.

39
00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.240
Make attainable goals.

40
00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.500
This is amazing.

41
00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:26.720
I'm going to walk with you.

42
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:27.460
Yay!

43
00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:28.500
Well, I'm excited.

44
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.000
We'll do it together.

45
