00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:26.320
And all I kept hearing was both of you ladies in my head saying, just go for it.

225
00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.040
Ask for what you want.

226
00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:31.040
And I'm so happy that I listened to you, ladies.

227
00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:34.420
