228
00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.880
I'm a single mom and every second with them counts.

229
00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.200
Thank you, ladies.

230
00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.360
Well, that makes me so happy.

231
00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:42.320
Aw.

232
00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.400
Well, Cecilia, that makes us so happy to hear.

233
00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:46.240
And what?

