00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.620
Oh, Sam is waving at me.

235
00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.680
Jenna, before we go to break, Sam, what do you got?

236
00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:54.420
I wanted to let you guys know on the Office Ladies podcast fan page.

237
00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.960
I know you guys aren't on Facebook.

238
00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:57.480
We've heard of this, though, Jenna.

239
00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:57.840
Yes.

240
00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.080
People have shared with us.

241
00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.060
So hi, you guys.

242
00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:00.460
Hello.

243
00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:05.580
There is a whole thread of people agreeing with Cecilia that had similar experiences.

244
00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:09.640
There's a woman named Naomi Timmer who went in and told her boss she deserved more money

245
00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:13.020
after listening to that episode and got a raise.

246
00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:19.240
And then there's a whole thread of people underneath it who realized that they had been operating the

247
00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.540
same way, negotiating themselves down before they went in the interview, who are not going

